      "title": "Setup and model downloads",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LTX 2.5 DFR temporal refinement — diagnostic only\n\n1. Accept the LTX 2.5 license and download the split components.\n2. Build rank-450 stage-one Q8 pages from the original development-model Q8 pages.\n3. Build separate rank-450 plus Pixel-Spatial stage-two Q8 pages from the same original pages.\n4. Put the temporal latent upsampler in `ComfyUI/models/latent_upscale_models/`.\n5. Put the Pixel-Spatial IC-LoRA in `ComfyUI/models/loras/LTX-2.5/`.\n6. Run Preflight before generation.\n7. Queue the workflow after Preflight succeeds.\n\nThis diagnostic workflow uses exact prebaked spatial DFR pages, then one learned x2 temporal round. It preserves stage-one audio, changes 24 fps video to 48 fps at the same duration, and adds four real transformer evaluations per seam-aware tile. Current MLX visual parity is not production-ready: matched Q8 and BF16 probes show mid-clip color corruption. Use this workflow for diagnostics, not final output.\n\n### Downloads\n\n- [LTX 2.5 development transformer, distilled LoRA, components, and temporal upsampler](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5)\n- [Pixel-Spatial IC-LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Pixel-Spatial-Upscaler)"
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#15202b"
    },
